# Normalize all text files to LF line endings in the repository,
# regardless of each platform's local git config. Without this,
# Windows's core.autocrlf converts files to CRLF on checkout, which
# then conflicts with Prettier's default LF expectation - causing every
# file to show as "needs reformatting" on a Windows checkout even when
# nothing actually changed. Matches sals3-portal's own .gitattributes,
# added for the identical reason.
* text=auto eol=lf
